  "body": "The [Delete room API](https://matrix-org.github.io/synapse/latest/admin_api/rooms.html#delete-room-api) will kick out any existing *joined* members of the room, but does not (afaict) consider *invited* members.\r\n\r\nAnyone with a pending invite then gets a stuck invite, because we are unable to generate a leave event.",
